<title>NETHERLANDS: Int-Mueller net profit NLG 98.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Int-Mueller net profit NLG 98.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.07 vs   3.64</p>
<p>    Net profit			    98.1  vs  85.1</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  3.3  vs   3.00</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   127.4  vs 106.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected transport and trading company Internatio-Mueller NV to report a net profit of 91 million to 98 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Tax				     32.5  vs  20.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.40 vs   1.20</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
